      "side": 1,
      "message": "This has the feeling of something which should likely be an enum.  \n\nSo it looks like this sensor supports reading 3 temperatures off the same sensor.  We should probably establish a more clearly defined way to index into the right sensor.  Perhaps the offset should be a part of the devicetree properties for it?  \n\nKeith, any thoughts for how this would best be represented?",
